{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d1c886be916ac2803ff065a6f3fc84c28178e6454d0d6e348bcf6f54e7629021", "ja": "真美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和真美外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8bc37a63189a2f50c9ad9bd58630a0e6fbd6f162c81121db311235f42cf02fd1", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、地元TV局の取材！　真美と一緒に\nパワースポットとして有名な、青島にやってきた）", "zh": "（今天的工作是接受地方电视台的采访！和真美一起来到了以能量景点闻名的青岛）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "7195d8b96ad0a529543684d32ee8772d547625eecc3bd31e6f2c04f4510cb254", "ja": "青い空、白い雲！　まさに南国ですな～。", "zh": "蓝蓝的天空，白白的云！简直就是热带风情嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "3ea04a1b2a3fe1c1e282adb5e35e903742aa898563414289d4f2cef7922f817b", "ja": "ところで、どう？　兄ちゃん。\nそろそろパワー感じてきたんじゃない？", "zh": "话说回来，怎么样啊，哥哥？差不多该感受到力量了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "438b648eda32129729fda82be0a5437859b7ea9b1e81ba41e628a4ff69a73a70", "ja": "いや、パワースポットってそういうものじゃないと\n思うんだけど……真美はどうなんだ？", "zh": "不，我觉得能量景点不是那种东西吧……真美，你感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "fb2c3569fc4ce8f3f44c4fa6f84037b1a3fe627327feb416472c53353a1345f0", "ja": "真美？　真美はすごいよ！\n今ならあの強敵、モアイも倒せるかんね！", "zh": "真美？真美很厉害哦！\n现在的话，就连那个强敌摩艾也能打倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "f803eb563fb5b945f467389697e85d449fc8c02b8a1cf44ef78e20c8c6419b3b", "ja": "さぁ、どこからでもかかってこーい！", "zh": "来吧，尽管从任何地方攻过来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3c7278be88aee3684b91e8103dd670cd501193e142f15ff3769b603de3b7dab6", "ja": "なんでモアイ像と戦う前提なんだ……\nというか、青島にはいないけどな。", "zh": "为什么前提是要和摩艾像战斗啊……\n话说回来，青岛也没有摩艾像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b8dc1cf7c6742178ada65148a70e3744bbe6d7402c5a6efe1252e6b5ead0f32", "ja": "ええっ、モアイいないの！？\nかくなる上は……てやーっ！", "zh": "诶诶，摩艾像不在吗！？\n既然如此……嘿呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "27b9ae8f958da9ac512448abe15aa0fd05464ba9adf93de2bb148ff3269dd2c6", "ja": "あっ！？　真美、どこに行くつもりだ！！", "zh": "啊！？真美，你打算去哪儿！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "9e0f673209c8bb003d7454b3740668c4373c31c662247b173ce3b603a19fdee1", "ja": "止めないで、兄ちゃん！\n前世の記憶っぽい何かが、真美を呼んでるんだよ！", "zh": "别拦着我，哥哥！\n好像有什么前世的记忆在呼唤真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "64d9ce3de2097a2f21cc79e09c30714c097b14f7e11756fa71d53ba79d8b294c", "ja": "前世の記憶っぽい何かってなんだ！", "zh": "所谓像前世记忆一样的东西到底是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_012mam01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_012mam01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "21978f5fa2ad9a1d0fcad6064028a0f93fe8f343dd6d9a4a545654b2a32e9e60", "ja": "（結局、TV局の人の好意で、モアイ像も紹介する事に\nなった。集客効果があるといいな……！）", "zh": "（结果，在电视台工作人员的好意下，连摩艾石像也决定介绍一下。希望能起到吸引客人的效果……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
